      "type": "text",
      "text": "BiocharProduction and Storage\r\nThis protocol outlines the MRV and best practices for high-quality\r\ncarbon removal via biochar production and storage via a durable\r\nstorage pathway.\r\nView\r\nrequirements\r\nAbout Biochar Production\r\nand Storage\r\nAdoption deadline: 14\r\nNov 2026\r\nBiCRS\r\nProtocol\r\nv1.2\r\n->\r\n->\r\n->\r\n03/02/2026, 10:56 Biochar Production and Storage v1.2 — Isometric\r\nhttps://registry.isometric.com/protocol/biochar/1.2 1/103"
    },
