    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(Equation 6)\r\nWhere:\r\n- the total GHG emissions for a\r\nReporting Period, RP, in tonnes of CO e.\r\n- the total GHG emissions\r\nassociated with project establishment for a RP, in\r\ntonnes of CO e, , see Section 8.6.1.\r\n- the total GHG emissions\r\nassociated with operational processes for a RP, in\r\ntonnes of CO e, see Section 8.6.2.\r\n- the total GHG emissions that\r\noccur after the RP and are allocated to the RP, in\r\ntonnes of CO e, see Section 8.6.3.\r\n- the GHG emissions associated with\r\nThe Project’s impact on activities that fall outside of the\r\nsystem boundary of a Project, over a given RP, in tonnes\r\nof CO e, see Section 8.6.4.\r\nThe following sections set out specific quantification\r\nrequirements for each variable.\r\nCO2eEmissions, RP = CO2eEstablishment, RP + CO2eOperations, RP\r\n+CO2eEnd−of−life, RP + CO2eLeakage,RP\r\nCO2eEmissions, RP\r\n2\r\nCO2eEstablishment, RP\r\n2\r\nCO2eOperations, RP\r\n2\r\nCO2eEnd−of−life, RP\r\n2\r\nCO2eLeakage, RP\r\n2\r\nGHG emissions associated with\r\nshould include all historic emissions incurred as a result of\r\nproject establishment, including but not limited to the SSRs\r\nset out in Table 1.\r\n8.6.1\r\nCalculation of CO₂eEstablishment, RP\r\nCO2eEstablishment, RP\r\n03/02/2026, 10:56 Biochar Production and Storage v1.2 — Isometric\r\nhttps://registry.isometric.com/protocol/biochar/1.2 49/103"
