      "type": "text",
      "text": "MONITORING\r\nPARAMETER DESCRIPTION\r\nMETHOD /\r\nINSTRUMENT FREQUENCY\r\nREQUIRED /\r\nRECOMMENDED\r\nPyrolysis Process Monitoring\r\nPyrolysis\r\nTemperature\r\nReactor operating\r\ntemperature\r\nInline\r\nthermocouples\r\nContinuous (5-min\r\nintervals)\r\nRequired\r\nResidence Time\r\nFeedstock\r\nresidence time in\r\nreactor\r\nProcess control\r\nsystem\r\nContinuous (5-min\r\nintervals)\r\nRequired for\r\ndistributed kilns\r\nonly, otherwise\r\nrecommended\r\nReactor\r\nPressure\r\nInternal pressure\r\nof pyrolysis\r\nreactor\r\nPressure sensor\r\n(2% accuracy)\r\nContinuous (1-min\r\nintervals)\r\nRequired, if the\r\nreactor operates\r\nat high pressure\r\nLeakage\r\nMonitoring\r\n(Option 1)\r\nOutflow sensors\r\ncombined with\r\nValidated Reactor\r\nModel\r\nMass balance &\r\nKinetics model\r\nverification\r\nContinuous\r\nRequired (if\r\nchosen as the\r\nmonitoring\r\nmethod)\r\nLeakage\r\nMonitoring\r\n(Option 2)\r\nContinuous\r\nreactor vessel\r\npressure stability\r\nmonitoring\r\nCalibrated\r\nSensor (±2%\r\naccuracy)\r\nContinuous (Every 1\r\nmin)\r\nRequired (if\r\nchosen as the\r\nmonitoring\r\nmethod)\r\nLeakage\r\nMonitoring\r\n(Option 3)\r\nPhysical leakage\r\ntesting\r\nAccredited test\r\n(ASTM E1003-13\r\nor equivalent)\r\nAnnual\r\nRequired (if\r\nchosen as the\r\nmonitoring\r\nmethod)\r\nGas Flow Rate &\r\nComposition\r\n(Option 1)\r\nMeasure gas flow\r\nplus CH , N O,\r\nCO, CO\r\ncomposition\r\nInline analyzer\r\nContinuous (1-min\r\nintervals)\r\nRequired (if\r\nchosen over\r\nemissions\r\ntesting)\r\nEmissions\r\nTesting (Option\r\n2)\r\nAccredited\r\nemissions testing\r\nAccredited\r\ntesting + flue\r\nstack temp\r\nPeriodic /\r\ncontinuous temp\r\nRequired (if\r\nchosen over flow\r\nrate &\r\n4 2\r\n2\r\n03/02/2026, 10:56 Biochar Production and Storage v1.2 — Isometric\r\nhttps://registry.isometric.com/protocol/biochar/1.2 86/103"
