      "text": "MONITORING\r\nPARAMETER DESCRIPTION\r\nMETHOD /\r\nINSTRUMENT FREQUENCY\r\nREQUIRED /\r\nRECOMMENDED\r\nif continuous not\r\nfeasible\r\ncomposition\r\nmonitoring)\r\nBiochar Production Monitoring\r\nBiochar Output\r\nWeight of biochar\r\nproduced\r\nAutomated\r\nweighing system\r\n+ manual\r\ncalibration\r\nPer Production or\r\nStorage batch\r\nRequired\r\nBiochar Quality Monitoring\r\nBiochar\r\nSampling\r\nLab analysis for\r\nquality\r\nparameters; see\r\nstorage Module\r\nfor specific\r\nparameter\r\nrequirements\r\nComposite\r\nsampling, ≥3\r\nsubsamples, sent\r\nto ISO 17025\r\naccredited lab\r\nEvery batch per\r\nMethod A and every\r\nminimum 10th Batch\r\nfor Method B\r\nRequired\r\nBiochar Placement & Application Monitoring\r\nBiochar\r\nPlacement\r\nQuantity\r\nemplaced or sold,\r\nrecipient details,\r\nbatch IDs\r\nWeigh scale\r\ntickets, delivery\r\nrecords\r\nDaily Required\r\nSee Relevant\r\nModule for\r\nAdditional\r\nRequirements in\r\nthis Section\r\n- - - Required\r\nEnvironmental Impact Monitoring\r\nEnvironmental\r\nImpact\r\nAssessment\r\nIndependent\r\nenvironmental\r\nimpact review\r\nExternal\r\nconsultancy\r\nAnnual\r\nRequired (unless\r\notherwise\r\njustified)\r\n03/02/2026, 10:56 Biochar Production and Storage v1.2 — Isometric\r\nhttps://registry.isometric.com/protocol/biochar/1.2 87/103"
