      "type": "text",
      "text": "MONITORING\r\nPARAMETER DESCRIPTION\r\nMETHOD /\r\nINSTRUMENT FREQUENCY\r\nREQUIRED /\r\nRECOMMENDED\r\nSee Relevant\r\nModule for\r\nAdditional\r\nRequirements in\r\nthis Section\r\n- - - Required\r\nSocial Impact Monitoring\r\nStakeholder\r\nEngagement\r\nLocal community\r\nengagement\r\nDocumented\r\nmeetings\r\nOngoing Required\r\nSocial Impact\r\nAssessment\r\nIndependent\r\nsocial impact\r\nreview\r\nExternal\r\nconsultancy\r\nAnnual\r\nRequired (unless\r\notherwise\r\njustified)\r\nQuality Assurance & Control Monitoring\r\nEquipment\r\nCalibration\r\nCalibration of\r\nscales, sensors,\r\nmeters\r\nDocumented\r\ncalibration\r\nAs per the\r\nmanufacturers\r\nrecommendation, or\r\nannually\r\nRequired\r\nLaboratory\r\nQA/QC\r\nAnalytical QA/QC\r\nincluding\r\nreplicates, blanks\r\nLaboratory\r\nQA/QC protocols\r\nOngoing Required\r\nData\r\nManagement\r\nStorage and\r\nretention of all\r\nrecords\r\nSecure cloud\r\ndatabase\r\nContinuous (≥5\r\nyears)\r\nRequired\r\n03/02/2026, 10:56 Biochar Production and Storage v1.2 — Isometric\r\nhttps://registry.isometric.com/protocol/biochar/1.2 88/103"
